# Set to True when the app runs behind a reverse proxy (Caddy in production).
# Used to record the signer's real IP address on electronic waivers.
# Leave False when running `python server.py` directly.
# Set to True when behind reverse proxy like Caddy in prod or False when running `python server.py` directly
